WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.936
-This is so fun.
Thank you for joining us.

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.437
Guys, here's how
the game works --

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.038
In front of us,
we have two envelopes

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:07.340
containing confessions,
okay?

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.908
In one of the envelopes
is something

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.310
that actually happened
to us in real life,

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.712
and the second envelope
is a lie.

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:15.114
Once you've read
your confession,

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:17.650
the other two players have
60 seconds to interrogate you,

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.819
and then they each have to guess

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.787
whether you've been lying
or telling the truth.

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:24.123
Okay.
We'll take one turn each.

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:25.591
-Sure.
-So, let's get started.

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:26.759
Jennifer, you go first.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:29.028
John, which envelope should
Jennifer open?

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:30.429
-Um, two?

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:31.865
-Yes.
-Two.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.232
-Yeah, I'm feeling two, as well.

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:34.066
-Envelope two.

00:00:34.066 --> 00:00:35.467
-Interesting, interesting.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:36.970
-It just says "pregnant."

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.204
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.206
It just says "not pregnant."

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.306
-Interesting.

00:00:41.306 --> 00:00:42.909
-I once took an Ambien

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.778
before filming a scene
in "The Hunger Games."

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.780 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:54.053 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.289 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.524 line:0%
-Okay.
-Was the scene --

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:00.626 line:0%
Were you sleeping in the scene?

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:02.228 line:0%
-No.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.397 line:0%
-You were not? You were awake?
-No. In fact, I was dancing.

00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:07.800 line:0%
