00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:15.675 line:0%
-No. No.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:17.443 line:0%
Do I just answer in yes or no?
Can I elaborate?

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:18.878 line:0%
-Yeah, you can elaborate.
Sure.

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:19.912 line:0%
-Okay.
Yeah, that wouldn't be fun.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.247 line:0%
No.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.515 line:0%
It wasn't a dance scene.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:26.285 line:0%
No, I just -- I woke up,
and, I, um...

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:27.586 line:0%
-Did you do it by mistake?

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:29.923 line:0%
-Yeah. I thought it was
something else.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.156 line:0%
-As a confession, is this --

00:01:31.156 --> 00:01:33.026 line:0%
-It was normal to take. Anyway.
-If this is true,

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:36.663 line:0%
