00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.891
-It's plausible.
-Yeah.

00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:07.626
-It's reckless.
-Yeah. Oh...

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:10.363
-I kind of like it.

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:13.632
If it's not true,
I am gonna be very sad.

00:02:13.632 --> 00:02:14.834
I'm saying it's true.

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:19.405
I'm gonna say...

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:21.640
You're that much good -- I think
