with this decision.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.345
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:27.346
-Like, how long?
-No, no, no, no.

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:28.414
-I say it's true.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:30.349
-It's true.

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:31.918
-Yes!
-Oh, wow!

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:33.586
-Yes! Yes!
-Unfortunately.

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:34.654
-Oh, no, no, no!

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:37.289
-Did anyone know?
-Forget the rest of this.

00:02:37.289 --> 00:02:38.424
-I know.
Forget these, yeah.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.893
-We're done, we're done.
-We have to move on.

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:42.061
-Yeah, okay.
-Okay.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:44.663
Here we go. My turn.
Which envelope, Jennifer?

00:02:44.663 --> 00:02:46.699
-Liar!
-No, I can't say liar.

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.634
-The first one.
-First one.

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:53.139
