00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:02.375 line:0%
-So you called him?

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.043
-Yes.

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:06.645
-That's the part I don't buy.

00:04:06.645 --> 00:04:08.147
-Oh, we're out of time.
-You would text him.

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:10.450
